  "job_B19.5_20251003_114444": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6s eadgan Berhtinus ciricean sume sunnan uhtan, \u00fea \u00f0\u00e6r man r\u00e6dde \u00fea SE05B15 \u00dea meahte he gehyran ond gangan, ond he ferde bli\u00fee tu his huse. SE07A1 On \u00f0one VII d\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s martyres tid sancti Synoti, \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6sse bi\u00fe gemeted SE08A1 On \u00f0one VIIIan d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees by\u00f0 sancta Marian acennednes. SE08A2 Hyre f\u00e6der w\u00e6s nemned Ioachim ond hire modor Anna, ond hi w\u00e6ron XX geara somod SE08A4 \u00dea w\u00e6ron swi\u00fee unrote. SE08A5 \u00dea o\u00feywde godes engel hiora \u00e6g\u00f0rum onsundrum hine ond him s\u00e6de \u00f0\u00e6t hi sceoldon SE08A8 \u00d0a efter XX gearum cende Anna, ond hieo nemde \u00fea Maria. SE08A10 Ond \u00fea hio w\u00e6s \u00fereo geara eald, \u00f0a l\u00e6ddon hi f\u00e6der ond modor to Hierusalem ond SE08A14 \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t cild sona snotor ond anr\u00e6de ond swa fulfremed \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nig \u00e6\u00feelicor ne sang SE08A18 Ond on hyre m\u00e6gdenhade hio dyde fela wundra on webgeweorce ond o\u00ferum cr\u00e6ftum \u00f0\u00e6s SE08B1 On \u00f0one ylcan d\u00e6g by\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s bisceopes geleorudnes sancti Audomari, se dyde monig SE08B3 \u00dea he his gast asende, \u00fea w\u00e6s in \u00feam huse wynsum stenc, swa hit w\u00e6re mid eallum SE08B7 Ond his wundra w\u00e6s sum \u00f0\u00e6t sum mon sealde o\u00ferum scilling se",
